00:28:54.090 --> 00:28:55.250
Like, that's so special.
真的，那太特别了。

692
00:28:55.430 --> 00:28:56.030
It was so fun.
那真的太有趣了。

693
00:28:56.030 --> 00:28:57.170
It was so fun.
那真的太有趣了。

694
00:28:57.310 --> 00:28:59.550
Like, I'm so glad I wanted to mention that.
