00:31:54.910 --> 00:31:55.950
That's what I say.
我就是这么说的。

759
00:31:56.230 --> 00:31:59.030
You know, we got more fan mail from this cold open.
你知道吗，我们因为这个开场片段收到了更多的粉丝来信。

760
00:31:59.210 --> 00:32:02.770
A fan mail flurry, in fact, and it all happened at 24 seconds.
事实上，粉丝来信如雪片般飞来，而且全都是在24秒那个节点发生的。

761
00:32:03.210 --> 00:32:07.410
It's when Phyllis is standing at the water cooler at the very beginning.
就是菲利斯在最开始站在饮水机旁的时候。

762
00:32:08.050 --> 00:32:12.650
And I guess she's filling her purple mug, by the way, with water.
顺便说一下，我猜她当时正在用那个紫色的杯子接水。

763
00:32:12.850 --> 00:32:14.410
Here's what people said.
以下是人们的评论。

764
00:32:14.930 --> 00:32:20.630
Not a question, but I need you ladies to see and acknowledge how Phyllis is holding her mug.
这不是个问题，但我需要你们女士们看看并确认一下菲利斯拿杯子的姿势。

765
00:32:20.750 --> 00:32:23.630
It kills me every time, and I can't unsee it.
每次看到我都快笑死了，而且我再也无法忽视它了。

766
00:32:23.910 --> 00:32:27.170
Other people said, why is Phyllis holding her mug like that?
其他人说，为什么菲利斯那样拿她的杯子？

767
00:32:27.290 --> 00:32:29.450
Does she hold her mug like that in real life?
她在现实生活中也是那样拿杯子的吗？

768
00:32:29.670 --> 00:32:33.930
When you pause the scene, it looks like it's not even her arm holding the mug.
当你暂停画面时，看起来那甚至都不像是她自己的手臂在拿杯子。

769
00:32:34.350 --> 00:32:37.170
I didn't notice it the first time I watched it.
我第一次看的时候没注意到。

770
00:32:37.270 --> 00:32:38.070
Do you have a picture?
你有照片吗？

771
00:32:38.430 --> 00:32:41.830
I didn't, because I didn't think it was all that strange.
我没有，因为我觉得这没什么奇怪的。

772
00:32:41.830 --> 00:32:42.690
I don't know.
我不知道。

773
00:32:42.750 --> 00:32:45.710
We can put a picture on the Office Ladies pod Instagram.
我们可以把照片发到Office Ladies播客的Instagram上。

774
00:32:46.390 --> 00:32:47.970
She's holding it normally.
她拿杯子的姿势很正常啊。

775
00:32:48.230 --> 00:32:50.650
But a fan mail flurry, Angela.
但粉丝来信真的很多，安吉拉。

776
00:32:50.750 --> 00:32:52.570
Like, tons of letters.
就像，成吨的信件。

777
00:32:53.090 --> 00:32:55.610
I want to know, how is everybody else holding their mugs?
我想知道，其他人是怎么拿杯子的？

778
00:32:55.710 --> 00:32:56.230
I don't know.
我不知道。

779
00:32:56.310 --> 00:32:59.150
I missed this moment, and now I want to go back and see it.
我错过了这个瞬间，现在我想回去看看。

780
00:32:59.630 --> 00:33:01.650
I'll put it in stories, and I'll do a poll.
我会把它发到快拍里，并做一个投票。

781
00:33:01.890 --> 00:33:03.530
Is she holding it normal or not?
她拿杯子的姿势正常吗？

782
00:33:04.030 --> 00:33:04.770
I agree.
我同意。

783
00:33:04.770 --> 00:33:11.610
I'll tell you what I did notice at 24 seconds was over Daryl's shoulder, you can see a plaque.
我告诉你我在24秒时注意到了什么，在达里尔的肩膀上方，你可以看到一块牌匾。

784
00:33:11.810 --> 00:33:20.710
And it says, in appreciation of dedicated service for Mary Wall, executive assistant to Robert Dunder and Robert Mifflin.
上面写着，感谢玛丽·沃尔的敬业服务，她是罗伯特·邓德和罗伯特·米夫林的行政助理。

785
00:33:20.710 --> 00:33:24.010
And it has a photo of Mary Wall, who was Greg Daniels' assistant.
上面还有玛丽·沃尔的照片，她是格雷格·丹尼尔斯的助理。

786
00:33:24.150 --> 00:33:24.430
Aw.
啊。

787
00:33:24.830 --> 00:33:25.090
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

788
00:33:25.150 --> 00:33:25.890
That's so great.
那太棒了。

789
00:33:26.070 --> 00:33:28.830
Well, there is an extended producer's cut for this episode.
嗯，这一集有一个加长的制片人剪辑版。

790
00:33:28.830 --> 00:33:33.870
If you have the DVD, you will have noticed there are no deleted scenes, just this longer producer's cut.
如果你有DVD，你就会发现里面没有删减片段，只有这个更长的制片人剪辑版。

791
00:33:33.870 --> 00:33:43.370
And at the end of this cold open, Phyllis doesn't say all of the rain cliches, so they don't get hot chocolate, right?
在这个开场片段的结尾，菲利斯没有说出所有的雨天陈词滥调，所以他们没能喝到热巧克力，对吧？

792
00:33:43.650 --> 00:33:43.810
Yeah.
是的。

793
00:33:44.310 --> 00:33:47.350
And the extended producer's cut, the scene goes on one more beat.
而在加长的制片人剪辑版里，这个场景多延续了一拍。

794
00:33:48.090 --> 00:33:59.810
And Jim decides to get hot chocolate just for Phyllis and him and announces that, oh, my gosh, Jenna, you as Pam, your reaction to this is so, like, what?
吉姆决定只给菲利斯和他自己买热巧克力，然后宣布了这件事，天哪，珍娜，你作为帕姆，你对此的反应简直是，什么鬼？

795
00:34:00.430 --> 00:34:04.850
I didn't remember that, and my reaction as Jenna is the same.
我不记得那个了，而且我作为珍娜的反应也是一样的。

796
00:34:04.890 --> 00:34:06.350
What is that about?
那是怎么回事？

797
00:34:06.610 --> 00:34:10.330
That's, you go, you look at him, and you're like, ha, excuse me?
就是，你转过头看着他，表情就像是，哈，你说什么？

798
00:34:10.730 --> 00:34:13.250
Like, you're so, like, ticked off.
就像，你非常，非常生气。

799
00:34:13.250 --> 00:34:21.350
I laughed so hard, I rewound it, because Pam's expression in this moment just doesn't, like, seem like her at all.
我笑得太厉害了，还倒回去重看，因为帕姆在那一刻的表情看起来一点都不像她。

800
00:34:21.530 --> 00:34:25.870
Well, I have to say, I feel like it's justified, this reaction.
嗯，我得说，我觉得这种反应是合理的。

801
00:34:26.130 --> 00:34:27.710
I want to put it in stories.
我想把它放进故事里。

802
00:34:28.170 --> 00:34:29.610
It just made me laugh.
这真的让我笑了。

803
00:34:29.810 --> 00:34:31.110
I just cracked up.
我直接笑喷了。

804
00:34:31.530 --> 00:34:33.790
Clearly, Pam loves hot chocolate.
显然，帕姆很喜欢热巧克力。

805
00:34:34.010 --> 00:34:34.790
That's what I learned.
这就是我学到的。

806
00:34:35.070 --> 00:34:36.590
Well, also, what is that?
嗯，还有，那是什么？

807
00:34:36.750 --> 00:34:42.430
Like, was Jim rooting against the rest of the office, and then him and Phyllis get hot chocolate,
比如，吉姆当时是在和办公室其他人作对吗？然后他和菲利斯喝了热巧克力，

808
00:34:42.430 --> 00:34:43.610
but everybody else doesn't.
但其他人却没有。

809
00:34:43.650 --> 00:34:45.250
I thought we were all in it together, Jim.
吉姆，我以为我们是同舟共济的。

810
00:34:46.230 --> 00:34:48.830
Maybe that's why it's in the extended producer's cut.
也许这就是为什么它出现在加长版制片人剪辑里。

811
00:34:49.170 --> 00:34:50.670
And now the episode starts.
现在剧集开始了。

812
00:34:51.110 --> 00:34:53.610
Still no Nellie bobblehead in the opening credits.
片头字幕里还是没有奈利的摇头娃娃。

813
00:34:53.690 --> 00:34:53.890
No.
没有。

814
00:34:54.030 --> 00:34:55.150
No Nellie little figure there.
那里没有奈利的小人偶。

815
00:34:55.690 --> 00:34:57.610
Andy and Aaron return to the office.
安迪和亚伦回到了办公室。

816
00:34:57.630 --> 00:35:03.690
They're singing their version of My Boyfriend's Back, and I thought something was kind of suspicious.
他们唱着他们版本的《我男友回来了》，我觉得有点不对劲。

817
00:35:04.050 --> 00:35:07.550
Andy says, even though it's the end of the day, they just wanted to stop by and say hello.
安迪说，虽然已经是下班时间了，但他们只是想顺道过来打个招呼。

818
00:35:07.890 --> 00:35:09.810
Why is he in a full suit and tie?
为什么他穿着全套西装打着领带？

819
00:35:10.130 --> 00:35:11.730
And they're showing up at the end of the day.
而且他们是在下班时间出现的。

820
00:35:11.730 --> 00:35:13.850
Why is Aaron in tank tops and jeans?
为什么亚伦穿着背心和牛仔裤？

821
00:35:14.030 --> 00:35:14.930
I don't understand.
我不明白。

822
00:35:15.290 --> 00:35:15.690
I have wondered that, too.
我也一直很纳闷。

823
00:35:16.190 --> 00:35:19.390
Did they just get back from their drive?
他们刚从兜风回来吗？

824
00:35:19.670 --> 00:35:22.570
And he ran and put on a suit just to come in and say hi?
然后他跑去换上西装，就为了进来打个招呼？

825
00:35:22.990 --> 00:35:24.230
That's such a good point.
说得太对了。

826
00:35:24.270 --> 00:35:24.850
I know.
我知道。

827
00:35:25.170 --> 00:35:27.090
And then Andy says, hey, Kev.
然后安迪说，嘿，凯文。

828
00:35:27.150 --> 00:35:28.150
And Kevin's like, yeah.
凯文回道，嗯。

829
00:35:28.290 --> 00:35:29.530
And Andy says, nice sweater.
安迪说，毛衣不错。

830
00:35:29.670 --> 00:35:32.430
Because he's wearing Andy's Cornell sweater.
因为他穿着安迪的康奈尔大学毛衣。

831
00:35:32.870 --> 00:35:34.010
Kevin says, thank you.
凯文说，谢谢。

832
00:35:34.210 --> 00:35:35.790
Nellie was nice enough to give it to me.
奈利好心把它送给了我。

833
00:35:35.950 --> 00:35:36.610
She's sweet.
她人真好。

834
00:35:36.870 --> 00:35:39.090
I just wish there was pockets.
我只是希望它有口袋。

835
00:35:39.450 --> 00:35:39.770
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

836
00:35:39.770 --> 00:35:40.070
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

837
00:35:40.230 --> 00:35:40.410
Lady.
女士。

838
00:35:40.850 --> 00:35:41.170
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

839
00:35:41.390 --> 00:35:42.410
Kevin likes pockets.
凯文喜欢口袋。

840
00:35:43.250 --> 00:35:43.650
Yeah.
是啊。

841
00:35:43.890 --> 00:35:46.370
Because you can put things in pockets when you have them.
因为有口袋的话，你就可以往里面放东西。

842
00:35:47.750 --> 00:35:52.730
I was like, I guess now for the rest of my life when I hear anyone celebrating pockets,
我当时心想，我想以后余生里，每当我听到有人赞美口袋，

843
00:35:52.750 --> 00:35:53.690
I'm going to think of you.
我都会想到你。

844
00:35:53.830 --> 00:35:57.690
I guess the New Yorker just did a big article about the size of women's pockets.
我猜《纽约客》刚发了一篇关于女性口袋大小的大文章。

845
00:35:57.910 --> 00:35:58.430
I saw that.
我看到了。

846
00:35:58.430 --> 00:35:59.410
Everybody sent it to me.
每个人都发给我了。

847
00:35:59.530 --> 00:36:00.430
I saw that.
我看到了。

848
00:36:00.610 --> 00:36:03.270
I almost sent it to you, but I knew you were traveling.
我差点也发给你，但我知道你在旅行。

849
00:36:03.270 --> 00:36:05.050
I was like, I'll tell her when I see her.
我心想，等见到她再告诉她吧。

850
00:36:05.050 --> 00:36:08.390
Well, this scene with Andy and Aaron returning was actually longer.
嗯，安迪和亚伦回来的这一幕其实更长。

851
00:36:08.810 --> 00:36:15.090
It really cracked me up because Andy is trying desperately to tell the office about this romantic
这真的让我笑喷了，因为安迪拼命想跟办公室的人讲他那个浪漫的

852
00:36:15.090 --> 00:36:20.730
gesture he made driving to Florida to win Aaron over, but everyone keeps interrupting him.
举动，就是开车去佛罗里达挽回艾琳，但大家一直打断他。

853
00:36:20.910 --> 00:36:25.330
And it reminded me of when my husband and I are trying to tell our teenagers a story,
这让我想起我和丈夫试图给我们的青少年孩子讲故事的时候，

854
00:36:25.390 --> 00:36:28.550
but they get stuck on like some tiny detail and they get sidetracked.
他们总是纠结于某个微小的细节，然后就跑题了。

855
00:36:28.650 --> 00:36:28.950
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

856
00:36:28.950 --> 00:36:30.410
I want you to hear it.
我想让你们听听。

857
00:36:31.090 --> 00:36:31.850
Crazy story.
疯狂的故事。

858
00:36:33.090 --> 00:36:34.570
I drove all the way down to Florida.
我一路开车去了佛罗里达。

859
00:36:34.570 --> 00:36:36.110
She was not expecting it.
她完全没料到。

860
00:36:36.210 --> 00:36:37.990
Totally swept her off her feet, right?
彻底把她迷住了，对吧？

861
00:36:38.230 --> 00:36:39.030
How long was the drive?
开了多久的车？

862
00:36:39.230 --> 00:36:40.630
It's like a day and a half each way.
单程大概一天半。

863
00:36:40.810 --> 00:36:44.450
But when I got there, I went right up to the house and I was like...
但我到了那里，直接走到房子前，然后我说……

864
00:36:44.450 --> 00:36:45.210
A day and a half?
一天半？

865
00:36:45.570 --> 00:36:47.170
My lumbar would be killing me.
我的腰肯定要断了。

866
00:36:47.490 --> 00:36:51.450
Oh, you should get this lumbar support cushion thing my dad has.
噢，你应该买个我爸用的那种腰部支撑垫。

867
00:36:51.530 --> 00:36:52.030
What's it called?
叫什么名字？

868
00:36:52.390 --> 00:36:54.830
Um, not easy reSt.
嗯，不是Easy Rest。

869
00:36:55.230 --> 00:36:57.270
That gas must have cost a pretty penny, huh?
那油费肯定花了不少钱吧，嗯？

870
00:36:57.410 --> 00:36:58.290
Well, he's got a Prius.
呃，他开的是普锐斯。

871
00:36:58.290 --> 00:36:59.310
How many times did you fill the tank?
你加了几次油？

872
00:36:59.430 --> 00:36:59.590
Three?
三次？

873
00:36:59.790 --> 00:36:59.950
Four?
四次？

874
00:37:00.110 --> 00:37:01.790
What does gas cost down there?
那边的油价是多少？

875
00:37:02.270 --> 00:37:03.030
Lumbar buddy.
腰部伙伴（Lumbar buddy）。

876
00:37:03.510 --> 00:37:04.250
Lumbar buddy.
腰部伙伴。

877
00:37:04.470 --> 00:37:04.950
Oh, yeah.
噢，对。

878
00:37:05.110 --> 00:37:05.510
Lumbar buddy.
腰部伙伴。

879
00:37:05.590 --> 00:37:06.730
Tell you what, I'll email you the story.
这样吧，我把故事发邮件给你们。

880
00:37:07.390 --> 00:37:14.990
Those moments.
那些瞬间。

881
00:37:15.250 --> 00:37:18.210
They're the small moments, but I just love them.
虽然都是些小瞬间，但我就是很喜欢。

882
00:37:19.990 --> 00:37:23.410
Well, not only is Kevin wearing Andy's Cornell sweater,
嗯，凯文不仅穿着安迪的康奈尔大学毛衣，

883
00:37:23.690 --> 00:37:28.350
he sees that Dwight has his fisherman statue Old Salty on his desk.
他还看到德怀特的桌上放着他的渔夫雕像“老咸水”。

884
00:37:28.510 --> 00:37:28.770
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

885
00:37:28.990 --> 00:37:31.970
And Dwight says, oh, yeah, Nellie gave it to him.
德怀特说，噢，对，是奈莉给他的。

886
00:37:32.150 --> 00:37:33.930
He turned it into a bobblehead.
他把它改造成了一个摇头娃娃。

887
00:37:33.930 --> 00:37:39.570
He's done a bit of an X-Men fan fiction, and he calls it Captain Mutato, Half Man, Half
他写了一点《X战警》同人小说，他管它叫“突变队长”，半人，半

888
00:37:39.570 --> 00:37:40.050
Mermaid.
美人鱼。

889
00:37:40.530 --> 00:37:40.730
Yeah.
是啊。

890
00:37:40.950 --> 00:37:44.610
So we learned Dwight writes fan fiction, and this made me very curious.
所以我们得知德怀特会写同人小说，这让我非常好奇。

891
00:37:44.650 --> 00:37:47.330
Is there a lot of X-Men fan fiction out there?
市面上有很多《X战警》的同人小说吗？

892
00:37:47.530 --> 00:37:48.230
Oh, sure.
噢，当然。

893
00:37:48.450 --> 00:37:49.210
Oh, lady.
噢，女士。

894
00:37:49.590 --> 00:37:49.930
There is...
有……

895
00:37:49.930 --> 00:37:51.770
I don't know why I know that, but yes.
我不知道我为什么会知道这个，但确实有。

896
00:37:51.930 --> 00:37:53.330
There is a lot.
有很多。

897
00:37:53.550 --> 00:37:55.190
There are many sites.
有很多网站。

898
00:37:55.190 --> 00:38:01.390
I found one called fanfiction.net, and since I was on there looking at X-Men fan fiction,
我找到了一个叫fanfiction.net的网站，既然我在上面看《X战警》同人小说，

899
00:38:01.570 --> 00:38:04.550
I thought, I wonder if this website has The Office fan fiction.
我就想，不知道这个网站有没有《办公室》的同人小说。

900
00:38:05.110 --> 00:38:08.290
Well, lady, I know something about The Office fan fiction.
嗯，女士，我对《办公室》的同人小说可是略知一二。

901
00:38:08.650 --> 00:38:10.410
Because it's been sent to me.
因为有人把它发给了我。

902
00:38:10.710 --> 00:38:10.910
What?
什么？

903
00:38:10.910 --> 00:38:16.570
There is a huge amount of Pam Ryan love story fan fiction.
网上有海量的帕姆和瑞安爱情故事同人小说。

904
00:38:16.850 --> 00:38:16.990
Yes!
是吗！

905
00:38:16.990 --> 00:38:17.390
Yes, okay.
对，没错。

906
00:38:17.590 --> 00:38:18.050
It is?
真的吗？

907
00:38:18.210 --> 00:38:18.730
Yes, okay.
对，没错。

908
00:38:18.970 --> 00:38:24.030
So on the fan fiction sites, there are several categories, and people can participate, I
在那些同人小说网站上，有几个不同的分类，我想人们可以参与到

909
00:38:24.030 --> 00:38:25.430
guess, in the different categories.
不同的分类中去。

910
00:38:25.710 --> 00:38:27.570
Here are a few that made me chuckle.
这里有几个让我忍俊不禁的。

911
00:38:27.570 --> 00:38:31.270
So there was a category titled Ryan Slash Pam.
有一个分类标题叫“瑞安/帕姆”。

