我会把它们指出来。

1220
00:52:29.060 --> 00:52:33.660
Starting with when Erin approaches Andy in the break room to say, hey, you know what?
从艾琳在休息室走近安迪说“嘿，你知道吗？”开始。

1221
00:52:33.800 --> 00:52:35.040
Don't worry about last night.
别担心昨晚的事。

1222
00:52:35.240 --> 00:52:36.400
It wasn't a big deal.
那没什么大不了的。

1223
00:52:36.400 --> 00:52:38.060
We were both tired, right?
我们当时都累了，对吧？

1224
00:52:38.380 --> 00:52:40.020
