While they were in a fight.
就在他们吵架的时候。

1246
00:53:30.640 --> 00:53:31.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1247
00:53:33.520 --> 00:53:36.300
Erin's going to seek out some advice from Dwight.
艾琳打算向德怀特寻求一些建议。

1248
00:53:36.520 --> 00:53:41.700
They sneak off to the stairwell where you have a private conversation in the world of Dunder Bifflin.
他们溜到楼梯间，在那里进行了一场邓德·米夫林世界里的私密谈话。

1249
00:53:41.700 --> 00:53:48.200
And she wants to know if he ever experienced penal softiosis when he was manager.
她想知道他当经理时是否经历过“阴茎软化症”。

1250
