He's like, absolutely not.
他说，绝对没有。

1251
00:53:50.760 --> 00:53:52.060
No, never happened.
不，从来没发生过。

1252
00:53:52.760 --> 00:53:55.900
I felt like Rain improvised at the end.
我觉得雷恩在最后即兴发挥了。

1253
00:53:56.000 --> 00:54:00.980
Because sometimes he would love to improvise as you were leaving a scene, kind of shout something out to you.
因为有时候他喜欢在你离开场景时即兴发挥，冲你喊点什么。

1254
00:54:01.300 --> 00:54:04.660
So I went to the shooting draft and he did.
所以我去查了拍摄剧本，他确实这么做了。

1255
00:54:04.660 --> 00:54:09.680
He improvised the Washington Monument and the Eiffel Tower.
他即兴提到了华盛顿纪念碑和埃菲尔铁塔。

1256
00:54:09.880 --> 00:54:17.140
And there was a third one that made it in the extended cut that was not in the aired version where he said, and Colossus at Rhodes.
还有一个在加长版里保留了下来，但在播出版本中没有，他说的是“还有罗德岛太阳神巨像”。

1257
00:54:17.580 --> 00:54:26.820
And then there was a brief little moment in the extended cut where Pam says to Kelly, hey, do you want to shop instead of having lunch today?
在加长版里还有一个简短的片段，帕姆对凯莉说，嘿，今天中午不去吃饭，去逛街怎么样？

1258
00:54:26.820 --> 00:54:28.240
And Kelly flips out.
凯莉反应很激烈。

1259
00:54:28.380 --> 00:54:29.300
She's like, seriously?
她说，认真的吗？

1260
00:54:30.040 --> 00:54:32.780
And that's when the scene starts of the two of them online shopping.
然后场景就开始了，两人开始网购。

1261
00:54:32.960 --> 00:54:34.160
It was Pam's invitation.
那是帕姆发出的邀请。

1262
00:54:34.460 --> 00:54:35.120
Pam's plotting.
帕姆在策划。

1263
00:54:35.380 --> 00:54:36.120
She's working it.
她在运作这件事。

1264
00:54:36.260 --> 00:54:37.360
Oh, I like that.
哦，我喜欢这个。

1265
00:54:37.480 --> 00:54:48.300
Well, I remember the very top of the scene got cut because what's happening at the very beginning of the scene is Kelly is buying every item in every color and every size.
我记得场景的最开头被剪掉了，因为场景最开始发生的是凯莉在买每一种颜色和每一种尺码的所有商品。

1266
00:54:48.300 --> 00:54:52.840
And Pam says, you're buying every color and every size.
帕姆说，你把每种颜色和尺码都买了。

1267
00:54:52.840 --> 00:54:55.000
And Kelly says it's free returns.
凯莉说，反正可以免费退货。

1268
00:54:55.360 --> 00:54:55.700
Yeah.
是啊。

1269
00:54:56.160 --> 00:54:57.900
And then the scene would have picked up.
然后场景就会接着往下演。

1270
00:54:58.000 --> 00:54:58.240
Yes.
是的。

1271
00:54:59.220 --> 00:55:06.480
Well, Pam is trying to remind Kelly of how unhappy she was with Ryan.
帕姆是在提醒凯莉她和瑞安在一起时有多不开心。

1272
00:55:06.960 --> 00:55:09.680
She's like, don't you remember when he cheated on you?
她说，你不记得他背叛你的时候了吗？

1273
00:55:09.800 --> 00:55:11.240
And she's like, which time?
凯莉说，你说的是哪一次？

1274
00:55:12.000 --> 00:55:13.960
Pam's looks to camera were very good.
帕姆看向镜头的眼神非常到位。

1275
00:55:14.240 --> 00:55:15.460
Well, Pam has a talking head.
帕姆有个访谈镜头。

1276
00:55:15.580 --> 00:55:17.640
She is not going to let Kelly throw her life away for Ryan.
她不会让凯莉为了瑞安而毁掉自己的生活。

1277
00:55:17.640 --> 00:55:20.860
And also, this has nothing to do with her access to her pediatrician.
而且，这和她能不能联系到儿科医生毫无关系。

1278
00:55:20.960 --> 00:55:22.420
She feels like that question was coming.
她觉得那个问题迟早会来。

1279
00:55:22.520 --> 00:55:23.060
She doesn't know why.
她不知道为什么。

1280
00:55:23.060 --> 00:55:23.940
She felt like it was.
她就是有这种感觉。

1281
00:55:24.100 --> 00:55:26.680
I thought you were really funny in this episode, Jenna.
我觉得你这一集演得特别好，珍娜。

1282
00:55:26.800 --> 00:55:28.240
I really enjoyed your performance.
我很享受你的表演。

1283
00:55:28.580 --> 00:55:30.240
I really liked this B story.
我真的很喜欢这条副线故事。

1284
00:55:30.520 --> 00:55:33.040
I really like going head-to-head with Ryan.
我真的很喜欢和瑞安针锋相对。

1285
00:55:33.040 --> 00:55:35.020
I love doing scenes with Mindy.
我喜欢和敏迪演对手戏。

1286
00:55:35.160 --> 00:55:35.800
So this was fun.
所以这很有趣。

1287
00:55:35.800 --> 00:55:39.100
Well, clearly the fans love it when Pam and Ryan go head-to-head.
显然粉丝们很喜欢看帕姆和瑞安针锋相对。

1288
00:55:39.180 --> 00:55:39.960
I guess so.
我想是吧。

1289
00:55:39.960 --> 00:55:42.140
As the fan fiction site will show you.
同人小说网站会证明这一点的。

1290
00:55:42.760 --> 00:55:47.140
There's now a scene in Nellie's office where Dwight is running down a list of things
现在奈莉办公室里有一场戏，德怀特正在列举办公室里发生的事情。

1291
00:55:47.140 --> 00:55:49.220
that are going on around the office.
这些事情正在办公室里发生。

1292
00:55:49.600 --> 00:55:51.220
Here's how it read in the script.
剧本里是这样写的。

1293
00:55:51.860 --> 00:55:55.200
Pam sent around a puppy clip that most found overrated.
帕姆发了一个小狗视频，大多数人觉得被高估了。

1294
00:55:55.940 --> 00:55:58.400
I think one of Toby's eyes is getting smaller.
我觉得托比的一只眼睛好像变小了。

1295
00:55:59.200 --> 00:56:02.340
Gabe bragged about having an extra ticket to an air show this weekend.
盖博吹嘘说他这周末多了一张航展的票。

1296
00:56:02.940 --> 00:56:04.280
Meredith expressed intereSt.
梅雷迪斯表示了兴趣。

1297
00:56:04.700 --> 00:56:06.740
Gabe then said his friend might be taking the ticket.
盖博随后说他的朋友可能要那张票。

1298
00:56:07.080 --> 00:56:08.160
I'll keep you posted.
我会随时通知你们。

1299
00:56:08.160 --> 00:56:12.540
Then he's going to spill the beans about Andy's impotence.
然后他要泄露安迪阳痿的事了。

1300
00:56:12.760 --> 00:56:13.100
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1301
00:56:13.640 --> 00:56:13.920
Hmm.
嗯。

1302
00:56:14.320 --> 00:56:18.560
And I think we should take a break because Nellie's going to call a whole conference room
我觉得我们该休息一下了，因为奈莉肯定会为此召集全员开一场会议。

1303
00:56:18.560 --> 00:56:19.380
meeting about it.
会议。

1304
00:56:19.620 --> 00:56:20.020
Yeah.
没错。

1305
00:56:20.280 --> 00:56:23.300
A really awkward conference room scene about it.
一场非常尴尬的会议室场景。

1306
00:56:23.480 --> 00:56:25.080
I was legitimately uncomfortable.
我当时真的感到很不自在。

1307
00:56:25.560 --> 00:56:27.600
I felt so bad for Andy.
我真为安迪感到难过。

1308
00:56:27.820 --> 00:56:28.180
Same.
我也是。

1309
00:56:28.600 --> 00:56:29.060
All right.
好了。

1310
00:56:29.060 --> 00:56:30.360
We'll talk all about it in a minute.
我们待会儿再细聊。

1311
00:56:30.460 --> 00:56:43.580
On that note, we are back.
言归正传，我们回来了。

1312
00:56:43.900 --> 00:56:45.800
Nellie is going to call a conference room meeting.
奈莉打算召集一场会议室会议。

1313
00:56:46.560 --> 00:56:48.460
And Andy's like, no, that's...
而安迪觉得不行，那是……

1314
00:56:48.460 --> 00:56:51.460
And then he pretends to call the conference room meeting, right?
然后他假装自己召开了会议，对吧？

1315
00:56:51.580 --> 00:56:53.140
Because she's not the manager.
因为她根本不是经理。

1316
00:56:53.780 --> 00:56:55.660
Go to 10 minutes, 34 seconds.
跳到10分34秒处。

1317
00:56:55.660 --> 00:56:57.700
You can see a box of jerseys.
你可以看到一箱球衣。

1318
00:56:59.480 --> 00:57:02.320
And there's a few kind of around the office.
办公室里到处都散落着一些。

1319
00:57:02.480 --> 00:57:05.580
You can see one plainly on the file cabinet by Dwight's desk.
在德怀特办公桌旁的文件柜上就能清楚地看到一件。

1320
00:57:05.840 --> 00:57:10.380
That's because there was a scene where Andy was still trying to get everyone to get on board
那是因为原本有个场景，安迪还在试图让大家支持

1321
00:57:10.380 --> 00:57:11.560
with this Rudy idea.
这个《鲁迪》的点子。

1322
00:57:11.560 --> 00:57:15.960
There's a whole scene in the extended cut where they're, like, passing out jerseys.
加长版里有一整段戏，他们在那儿分发球衣。

1323
00:57:16.000 --> 00:57:17.200
They're talking about the movie.
他们还在讨论那部电影。

1324
00:57:17.520 --> 00:57:20.160
And then Jim says, what about Spartacus?
然后吉姆说，那《斯巴达克斯》呢？

1325
00:57:20.220 --> 00:57:21.100
It's a whole thing.
那是一整段情节。

1326
00:57:22.800 --> 00:57:28.820
Well, Andy's going to look over his shoulder, and he sees the word importance written on the
好吧，安迪回头看了一眼，他看到白板上写着“重要性”这个词。

1327
00:57:28.820 --> 00:57:29.340
whiteboard.
白板。

1328
00:57:29.340 --> 00:57:34.880
And he's like, yes, this is about how everyone in the room is important.
他心想，没错，这一定是在说在座的每一个人都很重要。

1329
00:57:35.340 --> 00:57:37.280
And Robert corrects him.
然后罗伯特纠正了他。

1330
00:57:37.280 --> 00:57:40.800
Robert says, it doesn't say importance, Andy.
罗伯特说，安迪，那上面写的不是“重要性”。

1331
00:57:41.060 --> 00:57:42.880
It says impotence.
写的是“阳痿”。

1332
00:57:43.120 --> 00:57:44.080
You know what I thought?
你知道我在想什么吗？

1333
00:57:44.280 --> 00:57:44.580
What?
什么？

1334
00:57:44.780 --> 00:57:46.760
Sometimes we see what we need to see.
有时候我们只会看到自己想看到的东西。

1335
00:57:47.600 --> 00:57:48.120
Oh.
哦。

1336
00:57:48.720 --> 00:57:50.460
He needed to feel important.
他当时需要感觉到自己很重要。

1337
00:57:51.120 --> 00:57:51.500
Yeah.
是啊。

1338
00:57:52.180 --> 00:57:52.640
Sorry.
抱歉。

1339
00:57:54.020 --> 00:57:57.720
Didn't mean to be the sad aunt that points things out.
我不是故意要当那个扫兴的长辈，非要点破这些。

1340
00:57:58.420 --> 00:58:01.800
Nellie's going to take over the conference room meeting now, and she's going to explain
现在奈莉要接管会议室会议了，她要解释

1341
00:58:01.800 --> 00:58:07.120
that impotence is a human problem, and everyone starts weighing in.
阳痿是一个人类问题，然后大家就开始各抒己见。

1342
00:58:07.480 --> 00:58:07.740
Yeah.
没错。

1343
00:58:08.000 --> 00:58:11.360
Dwight says, not necessarily a human problem.
德怀特说，不一定是人类问题。

1344
00:58:12.100 --> 00:58:16.220
Flounders also experience this when converting from one gender to another.
比目鱼在进行性别转换时也会经历这种情况。

1345
00:58:16.500 --> 00:58:16.840
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1346
00:58:17.320 --> 00:58:18.160
Had to know.
我就知道会这样。

1347
00:58:18.440 --> 00:58:20.040
Did Dwight make this up?
德怀特是编的吗？

1348
00:58:20.300 --> 00:58:21.780
Or is some of it truth?
还是说其中有一部分是真的？

1349
00:58:22.100 --> 00:58:23.980
I almost looked it up, and I didn't.
我差点就去查了，但最后没查。

1350
00:58:24.060 --> 00:58:27.000
And I'm so glad you did, because it's bothered me that I don't know.
我真庆幸你没查，因为我一直不知道真相，这困扰我很久了。

1351
00:58:27.000 --> 00:58:31.760
This is classic Dwight, you guys, where he says something, and there's always a little
这就是典型的德怀特，伙计们，他说的话里，总会带有一点点

1352
00:58:31.760 --> 00:58:34.520
bit of truth, even though sometimes it sounds bizarre.
真相，尽管有时听起来很离谱。

1353
00:58:34.780 --> 00:58:38.340
I found an article titled, Hook, Line, and Science.
我找到了一篇题为《愿者上钩与科学》的文章。

1354
00:58:38.940 --> 00:58:40.420
I like it already.
我已经喜欢上它了。

1355
00:58:40.640 --> 00:58:43.180
And it had this to say about flounders.
文章里是这样评价比目鱼的。

1356
00:58:43.380 --> 00:58:48.940
New research shows that higher temperatures can masculinize southern flounder populations.
最新研究表明，较高的温度可以使南方比目鱼种群雄性化。

1357
00:58:49.360 --> 00:58:54.220
For many reptiles and some fishes, their sex can be determined by the temperatures
对于许多爬行动物和一些鱼类来说，它们的性别可以由

1358
00:58:54.220 --> 00:58:56.200
in their surrounding environment.
周围环境的温度来决定。

1359
00:58:57.120 --> 00:59:02.860
Southern flounder exhibits this temperature-dependent sex determination when exposed to warm or
南方比目鱼在幼体发育的关键时期暴露于温暖或

1360
00:59:02.860 --> 00:59:07.980
cold temperatures during a critical period in juvenile development and can cause genetic
寒冷的温度下时，会表现出这种温度依赖性的性别决定，并可能导致遗传上的

1361
00:59:07.980 --> 00:59:09.980
females to develop as males.
雌性发育为雄性。

1362
00:59:10.440 --> 00:59:11.760
But then are they impotent?
但它们会不育吗？

1363
00:59:11.900 --> 00:59:16.420
Well, I put an asterisk and said it doesn't mention anything about impotence.
嗯，我加了个星号，说文章里没提关于不育的事。

1364
00:59:16.640 --> 00:59:19.800
Well, we learned some very interesting things about flounders.
好吧，我们对比目鱼了解了一些非常有趣的事情。

1365
00:59:19.920 --> 00:59:22.280
But I said I guess Dwight is half right.
但我说我猜德怀特说对了一半。

1366
00:59:22.680 --> 00:59:22.980
Yeah.
是啊。

1367
00:59:23.360 --> 00:59:23.780
Okay.
好吧。

1368
00:59:24.060 --> 00:59:25.120
Very interesting.
非常有意思。

1369
00:59:25.340 --> 00:59:25.600
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

